{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WNnUpXJShAoWhDEmksZvGZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Gold validation 成为论文的杀手级证据：'Human annotations confirm that\n  structural features detect genuine stagnation — the zero-shot advantage is not a circular\n  artifact but reflects a real signal extraction efficiency gap.' Claim 1 用 gold F1 替代 LF F1\n  作为 headline number（稍低但 ground-truth validated），dominance claim 无需调整措辞。Circular\n  evaluation 从 'concern' 降级为 'caveat we addressed'。整体叙事从 'interesting finding with\n  circularity caveat' 升级为 'gold-validated practical guidance'。EMNLP main 有竞争力。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"gold-set\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: \"650 窗口人工标注（3 annotators, majority vote），评估所有方法在 ground-truth 上的真实性能\"\n    expected_results:\n      gold_n_windows: 650\n      annotator_count: 3\n      gold_kappa_fleiss: 0.82\n      gold_kappa_pairwise_mean: 0.83\n      gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.92\n      gold_stag_ratio: 0.29\n      disagreement_windows: 52\n      # Structural on gold\n      structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.9438\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.9187\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.9689\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.9485\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.9253\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.9717\n      # Probe on gold\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8612\n      probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.8034\n      probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.9190\n      # Structural advantage on gold\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp: 8.73\n      # LLM-judge on gold\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.6891\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.6203\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.7579\n      # TWV probe on gold\n      twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8549\n      # Cross-method comparison on gold\n      structural_gb_vs_llm_gold_pp: 25.94\n      probe_vs_llm_gold_pp: 17.21\n      # Gold vs MV disagreement analysis\n      gold_disagree_mv_n: 52\n      gold_disagree_mv_probe_correct_pct: 0.38\n      gold_disagree_mv_structural_correct_pct: 0.56\n      # Bootstrap CI (95%)\n      structural_gb_gold_ci95_low: 0.9301\n      structural_gb_gold_ci95_high: 0.9652\n      probe_gold_ci95_low: 0.8329\n      probe_gold_ci95_high: 0.8871\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档假设 Gold 标注高度验证 MV 标签质量。κ=0.82 表明 annotators 在 stagnation 判断上有\n      substantial agreement（SE 任务的 progress/stagnation 边界本身有主观性，但 window-level\n      5-step 序列给了足够上下文让标注者达成一致）。92% gold-MV agreement 意味着 MV pipeline\n      在绝大多数窗口上产出了正确标签——8% 的 disagreement 集中在 conf=1 的边界案例。\n\n      Structural features 在 gold 上的 F1 从 LF-eval 的 0.9951 降至 ~0.948，降幅 ~4.7pp，\n      这正是预期的：(1) structural features 部分通过 LF 输入特征逆向工程 LF 标签，失去这层\n      circular boost 后性能下降；(2) 但降幅很小，说明 structural features 确实捕获了真实\n      stagnation 信号——不仅仅是 LF 逻辑的映射。0.948 在 650 个 ground-truth 窗口上仍然是\n      近乎完美的检测能力。\n\n      Probe 在 gold 上的 F1=0.861 vs LF-eval 的 0.906 降 ~4.5pp，降幅类似。Probe 学到的\n      不完全是 LF 启发式，而是部分学到了真实语义信号。但 structural 仍领先 probe 8.7pp，\n      证明 zero-shot dominance 在 ground truth 上成立。\n\n      LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.689 vs LF-eval 的 0.663 微升 2.6pp——LLM 不受 circular eval\n      影响（本来就是独立评估），gold 标签略偏向 LLM 的语义判断，合理。但仍远低于 structural\n      和 probe，效率差距在 ground truth 上得到验证。\n\n      Gold 与 MV disagreement 的 52 个窗口中 structural 有 56% 正确率（高于 probe 的 38%），\n      进一步支持 structural features 检测的是真实停滞而非仅仅拟合 LF 规则。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gold F1-stag\", \"Gold F1-prog\", \"LF-eval F1\", \"Δ(Gold-LF)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural GB\", \"0.9485\", \"0.9253\", \"0.9717\", \"0.9951\", \"-4.66pp\"]\n          - [\"Structural RF\", \"0.9438\", \"0.9187\", \"0.9689\", \"0.9951\", \"-5.13pp\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (Qwen3)\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8034\", \"0.9190\", \"0.9055\", \"-4.43pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM-judge (zero-shot)\", \"0.6891\", \"0.6203\", \"0.7579\", \"0.6625\", \"+2.66pp\"]\n          - [\"TWV Probe\", \"0.8549\", \"0.7941\", \"0.9157\", \"0.9003†\", \"-4.54pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Fleiss' κ (3 annotators)\", \"0.82\"]\n          - [\"Mean pairwise Cohen's κ\", \"0.83\"]\n          - [\"Gold-MV agreement rate\", \"92.0%\"]\n          - [\"Disagreement windows\", \"52/650 (8.0%)\"]\n          - [\"Gold stag prevalence\", \"29.1%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of gold labels vs MV labels (650 windows), color-coded by confidence level. conf≥2 windows show near-perfect agreement (96%+), conf=1 windows account for majority of disagreements.\"\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart comparing all methods on gold set with 95% bootstrap CIs. Clear separation: structural > probe > LLM-judge, with non-overlapping CIs between structural and probe.\"\n      - \"Fig: Confusion matrix of gold vs MV labels, annotated with per-cell probe/structural accuracy — shows structural captures gold-correct-MV-wrong cases better.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Gold validation 是论文从 'interesting but circular' 升级到 'validated practical guidance'\n      的关键。8.7pp structural-probe gap 在 gold 上保持，证明 zero-shot dominance 不是 circular\n      artifact。论文可以用 gold F1 作为 headline number（0.948 vs LF-eval 的 0.995），虽然绝对值\n      略低但 ground-truth validated，reviewer 无法再 dismiss 为 circular。Circular evaluation\n      concern 通过一组数据彻底关闭：(1) structural gold F1 仅降 4.7pp 说明绝大部分信号是真实的；\n      (2) 即使在 gold-MV disagreement 的困难样本上 structural 仍优于 probe；(3) κ=0.82 证明\n      stagnation 本身是可靠标注的概念。\n\n  - name: \"llm-judge-fewshot\"\n    plan_id: \"llm-judge-fewshot\"\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge 加入 5-shot exemplars + chain-of-thought prompting，在 gold set 650 窗口上评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\"\n      mode: \"5-shot + CoT\"\n      n_windows: 650\n      gold_macro_f1: 0.7234\n      gold_f1_stag: 0.6712\n      gold_f1_prog: 0.7756\n      gold_accuracy: 0.7369\n      gold_precision_macro: 0.7518\n      gold_recall_macro: 0.7102\n      # vs zero-shot\n      delta_vs_zeroshot_pp: 3.43\n      # vs structural\n      structural_gb_advantage_pp: 22.51\n      # vs probe\n      probe_advantage_pp: 13.78\n      # Cost\n      api_cost_usd: 18.92\n      total_tokens: 4812000\n      avg_latency_ms: 3200\n      # Error analysis\n      stag_recall: 0.6389\n      stag_precision: 0.7081\n      common_FN_pattern: \"diverse-action stagnation where steps look productive in isolation\"\n      common_FP_pattern: \"repetitive but effective debugging loops\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档中 LLM-judge fewshot 仍 ≤0.75。Few-shot + CoT 相比 zero-shot 带来 ~3.4pp 提升\n      是合理的：exemplars 帮助 LLM 校准 stagnation 的 threshold（尤其是理解\"语义多样但无效\"\n      模式），CoT 迫使 LLM 显式推理窗口内的进度而非逐步评估。但提升有限的原因：\n\n      (1) Stagnation 是 window-level 的集体属性——LLM 在 single-pass reading 中难以稳定\n      追踪 5 步之间的 goal-directed coherence，few-shot 只教了\"什么算停滞\"但没教\"如何\n      系统性地追踪 progress across steps\"；\n\n      (2) LLM 的核心盲点在于 diverse-action stagnation（agent 做了编辑、运行、读文件等\n      多样操作，看起来 productive 但实际没有推进 goal），这类模式即使有 exemplars 也很难\n      被 LLM 通过单次阅读识别——需要对比前后状态差异，而非仅读动作序列；\n\n      (3) CoT 增加了 token 开销 ~60%，但换来的准确率提升有限，因为 stagnation 判断的\n      bottleneck 不是\"推理不够\"而是\"信息提取不够\"——LLM 需要的是结构化特征（文件变化频率、\n      命令重复率）而非更长的推理链。\n\n      0.723 仍大幅低于 structural 0.948（-22.5pp）和 probe 0.861（-13.8pp），效率差距\n      在 best-case LLM 配置下依然显著。这验证了核心 claim：structural features 的优势\n      不是因为 LLM baseline 太弱，而是任务本质上更适合结构化特征提取。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge Variants on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Configuration\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"F1-stag\", \"F1-prog\", \"Cost (USD)\", \"Latency/window\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Zero-shot\", \"0.6891\", \"0.6203\", \"0.7579\", \"$11.66†\", \"~2.1s\"]\n          - [\"5-shot + CoT\", \"0.7234\", \"0.6712\", \"0.7756\", \"$18.92\", \"~3.2s\"]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", \"0.9485\", \"0.9253\", \"0.9717\", \"$0\", \"<5ms\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8034\", \"0.9190\", \"$0\", \"~12ms\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Error Analysis — LLM Few-shot on Gold\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"Count\", \"%\", \"Dominant Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP (predicted stag, gold prog)\", \"72\", \"40.0%\", \"Repetitive debugging loops that are actually effective\"]\n          - [\"FN (predicted prog, gold stag)\", \"108\", \"60.0%\", \"Diverse-action stagnation looking productive\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Radar chart comparing zero-shot vs few-shot LLM judge across 6 dimensions (precision-stag, recall-stag, precision-prog, recall-prog, cost-efficiency, latency). Few-shot improves recall-stag most (+4pp) but at 60% higher cost.\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-judge fewshot 的 0.723 为论文提供了 strongest possible LLM baseline。即使在 few-shot +\n      CoT 的最优配置下，structural features 仍领先 22.5pp，probe 仍领先 13.8pp。这消除了\n      \"zero-shot baseline 太弱\" 的 reviewer concern。论文可以 claim：\"Even with optimized\n      prompting (5-shot + CoT), LLM-as-judge achieves only 0.723 F1 on gold-validated labels,\n      22.5pp below structural features — the efficiency gap is fundamental, not prompt-engineering\n      addressable.\" Cost comparison 更 dramatic：$18.92 for 650 windows vs $0 for structural。\n\n  - name: \"structural-feature-overlap-ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"structural-feature-overlap-ablation\"\n    description: \"从 30-dim structural vector 中移除所有与 LF 逻辑直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关 ~8 features + file_diff 相关 ~6 features），仅保留 ~16 个非重叠特征，在 gold set 上评估残差 F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_features: 30\n      removed_lf_overlap_features: 14\n      remaining_non_overlap_features: 16\n      removed_features_list: [\"cmd_rep_ratio\", \"cmd_rep_max_consecutive\", \"cmd_rep_unique_ratio\", \"cmd_rep_entropy\", \"cmd_rep_bigram_repeat\", \"cmd_rep_last3_repeat\", \"cmd_rep_pattern_score\", \"cmd_rep_binary\", \"file_diff_ratio\", \"file_diff_count\", \"file_diff_unique_files\", \"file_diff_lines_changed\", \"file_diff_binary\", \"file_diff_entropy\"]\n      remaining_features_examples: [\"output_length_mean\", \"output_length_std\", \"step_duration_mean\", \"error_rate\", \"unique_commands\", \"command_diversity\", \"directory_changes\", \"token_count_trend\", \"action_type_entropy\", \"response_length_ratio\", \"edit_revert_ratio\", \"tool_switch_rate\", \"semantic_similarity_mean\", \"output_novelty_score\", \"goal_mention_rate\", \"progress_keyword_ratio\"]\n      # Gold evaluation\n      overlap_ablation_gold_rf_macro_f1: 0.8821\n      overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_stag: 0.8412\n      overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_prog: 0.9230\n      overlap_ablation_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.8903\n      overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_stag: 0.8534\n      overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_prog: 0.9272\n      # Residual F1 (key metric)\n      residual_f1: 0.8903\n      residual_f1_ci95_low: 0.8651\n      residual_f1_ci95_high: 0.9127\n      # Comparison\n      full_30_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.9485\n      delta_vs_full_pp: -5.82\n      delta_vs_probe_pp: 2.91\n      # Feature importance (remaining)\n      top3_remaining_importance: [\"output_novelty_score\", \"action_type_entropy\", \"edit_revert_ratio\"]\n      # LF-eval for comparison\n      overlap_ablation_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.9312\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 overlap ablation residual F1 ≥0.85。移除 14 个与 LF 直接重叠的特征后\n      仍保持 0.890 的 gold F1，证明 structural signal 有独立于 LF 逻辑的信息贡献。\n\n      为什么残差 F1 高达 0.89：(1) 剩余 16 个特征（output novelty、action entropy、edit\n      revert 等）捕获了 stagnation 的\"行为指纹\"——停滞窗口不仅命令重复和文件不变，还\n      伴随 output 长度下降、行为多样性降低、工具切换频率下降等模式；(2) 这些特征虽然\n      与 LF 逻辑无直接重叠，但与 stagnation 有 causal 关系——真正停滞的 agent 会在多个\n      维度同时表现出退化；(3) GB 的非线性组合能力让 16 个弱特征的联合预测力接近 14 个\n      强特征的单独预测力。\n\n      降幅 5.8pp 是合理的：被移除的 14 个特征直接编码了 LF 的两个核心启发式（cmd_rep\n      和 file_diff），它们本身就是 stagnation 的强信号。但 \"强信号被移除后仍有 0.89\"\n      正是关键论证——structural approach 的价值不仅在于重新发现 LF 逻辑，而在于捕获\n      LF 未覆盖的补充维度。\n\n      Residual F1 0.89 > probe gold F1 0.86 (+2.9pp) 进一步强化了 structural approach\n      的优势论证：即使只用非 LF-overlap 的特征，structural 仍 ≥ probe。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Overlap Ablation on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"N features\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gold F1-stag\", \"Δ vs Full\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full structural\", \"30\", \"0.9485\", \"0.9253\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Non-overlap only\", \"16\", \"0.8903\", \"0.8534\", \"-5.82pp\"]\n          - [\"LF-overlap only\", \"14\", \"0.9289\", \"0.9051\", \"-1.96pp\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (ref)\", \"1024-dim\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8034\", \"-8.73pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Top Non-Overlap Feature Importances (GB, gold-evaluated)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature\", \"Importance\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"output_novelty_score\", \"0.183\", \"Low novelty in outputs → stagnation\"]\n          - [\"action_type_entropy\", \"0.156\", \"Low action diversity → stagnation\"]\n          - [\"edit_revert_ratio\", \"0.134\", \"High revert rate → ineffective edits\"]\n          - [\"token_count_trend\", \"0.098\", \"Declining token use → disengagement\"]\n          - [\"tool_switch_rate\", \"0.087\", \"Low tool switching → stuck in one mode\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Venn diagram showing 3 signal sources: LF-overlap features (14), non-overlap structural (16), and probe embedding. Overlap region labeled with gold F1 for each combination.\"\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance heatmap for 16 non-overlap features, split by gold-stag vs gold-prog predictions. Shows complementary signal dimensions beyond LF logic.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Overlap ablation 是 circularity concern 的最终解答。Reviewer 可能 argue \"structural\n      F1 高仅因为 features 直接编码了 LF 规则\"——ablation 证明即使移除所有 LF-overlap\n      features，残差 F1=0.89 仍然 (a) 远高于 random (0.50)，(b) 高于 probe (0.86)，\n      (c) 在实用部署范围内。论文叙事：\"Even after removing all features that overlap\n      with LF heuristics, the remaining 16 structural features achieve 0.89 F1 on\n      gold — demonstrating that structural stagnation detection captures signal\n      dimensions beyond what labeling functions encode.\" 这把 circular evaluation\n      从 \"fatal flaw\" 变成 \"well-characterized and controlled confound\"。\n\n  - name: \"cross-agent-instance-isolation\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent-instance-isolation\"\n    description: \"重新评估 cross-agent structural GB：确保 SWE-bench 训练集中无任何 instance 在 OH 测试集中出现（排除 shared benchmark instances 的信息泄露）\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Data split details\n      swe_train_instances: 344\n      oh_test_instances: 3394\n      shared_benchmark_instances: 0\n      note_on_sharing: \"SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 使用不同的 SWE-bench split，无 instance 共享；但此实验确认 structural features 不通过 problem-level 特征泄露\"\n      # Instance-level isolation protocol\n      isolation_method: \"确保 structural feature 中无 instance-identifying 信息（如 repo name encoding、issue ID）。对 OH test 按 repo 分层评估排除 repo-level 泄露。\"\n      # Results\n      gb_instance_isolated_macro_f1: 0.9612\n      gb_instance_isolated_f1_stag: 0.9403\n      gb_instance_isolated_f1_prog: 0.9821\n      # Per-repo stratification\n      gb_seen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9687\n      gb_unseen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9534\n      gb_unseen_repos_delta_pp: -1.53\n      # Comparison with original\n      gb_original_cross_agent_all: 0.9674\n      delta_vs_original_pp: -0.62\n      # Statistical test\n      mcnemar_p_vs_original: 0.43\n      bootstrap_ci95_low: 0.9498\n      bootstrap_ci95_high: 0.9719\n      # Probe comparison under same isolation\n      probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.5921\n      structural_advantage_isolated_pp: 36.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 instance isolation 后 GB ≥0.95。预测 0.961 的理由：\n\n      (1) SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 本身处理不同的 SWE-bench instances（不同 split），\n      所以 instance-level 信息泄露的风险本来就很低。Structural features（cmd_rep_ratio、\n      file_diff_count 等）是 agent 行为特征，不编码 problem identity——一个 agent 在\n      处理任何 bug 时的停滞行为模式是相似的（重复命令、文件不变、输出不变），与具体\n      修什么 bug 无关。\n\n      (2) 轻微降幅 0.62pp 来自 repo-level 的 minor distribution shift：某些 repo 的\n      代码结构可能导致 agent 行为模式略有不同（如大型 monorepo vs 小型 library），\n      但效应极小因为 structural features 在 abstraction level 上足够高——它们度量的是\n      行为模式（重复/变化/趋势）而非内容。\n\n      (3) Seen vs unseen repos 差距仅 1.5pp，证明 structural features 的跨域迁移不依赖\n      repo familiarity。这与 structural features 的设计一致：它们度量的是 agent 行为\n      的 meta-patterns（是否在重复、是否在变化），完全独立于具体代码库。\n\n      (4) Probe 在 isolation 条件下几乎不变（0.592 vs 0.598），因为 probe 的 zero-shot\n      failure 是 domain shift 问题而非泄露问题。Structural advantage 在 isolation 后\n      从 36.9pp 变为 36.9pp（几乎不变），进一步证明优势是真实的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instance Isolation Evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"GB Macro-F1\", \"F1-stag\", \"N windows\", \"Δ vs Original\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Original (all OH)\", \"0.9674\", \"0.9479\", \"150652\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Instance-isolated\", \"0.9612\", \"0.9403\", \"150652\", \"-0.62pp\"]\n          - [\"— Seen repos only\", \"0.9687\", \"0.9512\", \"89432\", \"+0.13pp\"]\n          - [\"— Unseen repos only\", \"0.9534\", \"0.9287\", \"61220\", \"-1.53pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Isolation Impact on All Methods\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Original\", \"Isolated\", \"Δpp\", \"McNemar p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural GB\", \"0.9674\", \"0.9612\", \"-0.62\", \"0.43\"]\n          - [\"Probe zero-shot\", \"0.5984\", \"0.5921\", \"-0.63\", \"0.71\"]\n          - [\"Advantage (struct-probe)\", \"+36.90pp\", \"+36.91pp\", \"+0.01\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Box plot of per-repo structural GB F1 分布，split by seen/unseen repos. Both distributions concentrated above 0.93 with high overlap, confirming repo-independence.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot: x=repo size (LOC), y=GB F1 under isolation. No correlation (r=0.03), confirming features are scale-invariant.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Instance isolation 实验关闭了最后一个 data leakage concern。降幅仅 0.62pp 且\n      统计不显著（McNemar p=0.43），证明 structural GB 0.967 的 cross-agent 性能是\n      genuine transfer 而非 information leakage artifact。Unseen repos 上仅降 1.5pp\n      更进一步：即使 agent 面对全新代码库，structural stagnation detection 仍然有效。\n      论文可以 claim：\"Cross-agent transfer is robust to instance isolation\n      (Δ=-0.62pp, p=0.43), confirming that structural features capture agent\n      behavioral patterns independent of the specific problem being solved.\"\n      与 probe 的对比在 isolation 条件下几乎完全不变（36.9pp），这是最干净的\n      dominance evidence。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38438,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38438},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9a91e77-a40a-45d4-af92-e3fde4b7646a","uuid":"c7d6b584-84d0-4b74-8690-bf8ada1eafad"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":168935,"duration_api_ms":171031,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Gold validation 成为论文的杀手级证据：'Human annotations confirm that\n  structural features detect genuine stagnation — the zero-shot advantage is not a circular\n  artifact but reflects a real signal extraction efficiency gap.' Claim 1 用 gold F1 替代 LF F1\n  作为 headline number（稍低但 ground-truth validated），dominance claim 无需调整措辞。Circular\n  evaluation 从 'concern' 降级为 'caveat we addressed'。整体叙事从 'interesting finding with\n  circularity caveat' 升级为 'gold-validated practical guidance'。EMNLP main 有竞争力。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"gold-set\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: \"650 窗口人工标注（3 annotators, majority vote），评估所有方法在 ground-truth 上的真实性能\"\n    expected_results:\n      gold_n_windows: 650\n      annotator_count: 3\n      gold_kappa_fleiss: 0.82\n      gold_kappa_pairwise_mean: 0.83\n      gold_mv_agreement_rate: 0.92\n      gold_stag_ratio: 0.29\n      disagreement_windows: 52\n      # Structural on gold\n      structural_rf_gold_macro_f1: 0.9438\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_stag: 0.9187\n      structural_rf_gold_f1_prog: 0.9689\n      structural_gb_gold_macro_f1: 0.9485\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_stag: 0.9253\n      structural_gb_gold_f1_prog: 0.9717\n      # Probe on gold\n      probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8612\n      probe_gold_f1_stag: 0.8034\n      probe_gold_f1_prog: 0.9190\n      # Structural advantage on gold\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_gold_pp: 8.73\n      # LLM-judge on gold\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_macro_f1: 0.6891\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_stag: 0.6203\n      llm_judge_zeroshot_gold_f1_prog: 0.7579\n      # TWV probe on gold\n      twv_probe_gold_macro_f1: 0.8549\n      # Cross-method comparison on gold\n      structural_gb_vs_llm_gold_pp: 25.94\n      probe_vs_llm_gold_pp: 17.21\n      # Gold vs MV disagreement analysis\n      gold_disagree_mv_n: 52\n      gold_disagree_mv_probe_correct_pct: 0.38\n      gold_disagree_mv_structural_correct_pct: 0.56\n      # Bootstrap CI (95%)\n      structural_gb_gold_ci95_low: 0.9301\n      structural_gb_gold_ci95_high: 0.9652\n      probe_gold_ci95_low: 0.8329\n      probe_gold_ci95_high: 0.8871\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档假设 Gold 标注高度验证 MV 标签质量。κ=0.82 表明 annotators 在 stagnation 判断上有\n      substantial agreement（SE 任务的 progress/stagnation 边界本身有主观性，但 window-level\n      5-step 序列给了足够上下文让标注者达成一致）。92% gold-MV agreement 意味着 MV pipeline\n      在绝大多数窗口上产出了正确标签——8% 的 disagreement 集中在 conf=1 的边界案例。\n\n      Structural features 在 gold 上的 F1 从 LF-eval 的 0.9951 降至 ~0.948，降幅 ~4.7pp，\n      这正是预期的：(1) structural features 部分通过 LF 输入特征逆向工程 LF 标签，失去这层\n      circular boost 后性能下降；(2) 但降幅很小，说明 structural features 确实捕获了真实\n      stagnation 信号——不仅仅是 LF 逻辑的映射。0.948 在 650 个 ground-truth 窗口上仍然是\n      近乎完美的检测能力。\n\n      Probe 在 gold 上的 F1=0.861 vs LF-eval 的 0.906 降 ~4.5pp，降幅类似。Probe 学到的\n      不完全是 LF 启发式，而是部分学到了真实语义信号。但 structural 仍领先 probe 8.7pp，\n      证明 zero-shot dominance 在 ground truth 上成立。\n\n      LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.689 vs LF-eval 的 0.663 微升 2.6pp——LLM 不受 circular eval\n      影响（本来就是独立评估），gold 标签略偏向 LLM 的语义判断，合理。但仍远低于 structural\n      和 probe，效率差距在 ground truth 上得到验证。\n\n      Gold 与 MV disagreement 的 52 个窗口中 structural 有 56% 正确率（高于 probe 的 38%），\n      进一步支持 structural features 检测的是真实停滞而非仅仅拟合 LF 规则。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gold-Validated Method Comparison (N=650)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gold F1-stag\", \"Gold F1-prog\", \"LF-eval F1\", \"Δ(Gold-LF)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural GB\", \"0.9485\", \"0.9253\", \"0.9717\", \"0.9951\", \"-4.66pp\"]\n          - [\"Structural RF\", \"0.9438\", \"0.9187\", \"0.9689\", \"0.9951\", \"-5.13pp\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (Qwen3)\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8034\", \"0.9190\", \"0.9055\", \"-4.43pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM-judge (zero-shot)\", \"0.6891\", \"0.6203\", \"0.7579\", \"0.6625\", \"+2.66pp\"]\n          - [\"TWV Probe\", \"0.8549\", \"0.7941\", \"0.9157\", \"0.9003†\", \"-4.54pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Fleiss' κ (3 annotators)\", \"0.82\"]\n          - [\"Mean pairwise Cohen's κ\", \"0.83\"]\n          - [\"Gold-MV agreement rate\", \"92.0%\"]\n          - [\"Disagreement windows\", \"52/650 (8.0%)\"]\n          - [\"Gold stag prevalence\", \"29.1%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of gold labels vs MV labels (650 windows), color-coded by confidence level. conf≥2 windows show near-perfect agreement (96%+), conf=1 windows account for majority of disagreements.\"\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart comparing all methods on gold set with 95% bootstrap CIs. Clear separation: structural > probe > LLM-judge, with non-overlapping CIs between structural and probe.\"\n      - \"Fig: Confusion matrix of gold vs MV labels, annotated with per-cell probe/structural accuracy — shows structural captures gold-correct-MV-wrong cases better.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Gold validation 是论文从 'interesting but circular' 升级到 'validated practical guidance'\n      的关键。8.7pp structural-probe gap 在 gold 上保持，证明 zero-shot dominance 不是 circular\n      artifact。论文可以用 gold F1 作为 headline number（0.948 vs LF-eval 的 0.995），虽然绝对值\n      略低但 ground-truth validated，reviewer 无法再 dismiss 为 circular。Circular evaluation\n      concern 通过一组数据彻底关闭：(1) structural gold F1 仅降 4.7pp 说明绝大部分信号是真实的；\n      (2) 即使在 gold-MV disagreement 的困难样本上 structural 仍优于 probe；(3) κ=0.82 证明\n      stagnation 本身是可靠标注的概念。\n\n  - name: \"llm-judge-fewshot\"\n    plan_id: \"llm-judge-fewshot\"\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge 加入 5-shot exemplars + chain-of-thought prompting，在 gold set 650 窗口上评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\"\n      mode: \"5-shot + CoT\"\n      n_windows: 650\n      gold_macro_f1: 0.7234\n      gold_f1_stag: 0.6712\n      gold_f1_prog: 0.7756\n      gold_accuracy: 0.7369\n      gold_precision_macro: 0.7518\n      gold_recall_macro: 0.7102\n      # vs zero-shot\n      delta_vs_zeroshot_pp: 3.43\n      # vs structural\n      structural_gb_advantage_pp: 22.51\n      # vs probe\n      probe_advantage_pp: 13.78\n      # Cost\n      api_cost_usd: 18.92\n      total_tokens: 4812000\n      avg_latency_ms: 3200\n      # Error analysis\n      stag_recall: 0.6389\n      stag_precision: 0.7081\n      common_FN_pattern: \"diverse-action stagnation where steps look productive in isolation\"\n      common_FP_pattern: \"repetitive but effective debugging loops\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档中 LLM-judge fewshot 仍 ≤0.75。Few-shot + CoT 相比 zero-shot 带来 ~3.4pp 提升\n      是合理的：exemplars 帮助 LLM 校准 stagnation 的 threshold（尤其是理解\"语义多样但无效\"\n      模式），CoT 迫使 LLM 显式推理窗口内的进度而非逐步评估。但提升有限的原因：\n\n      (1) Stagnation 是 window-level 的集体属性——LLM 在 single-pass reading 中难以稳定\n      追踪 5 步之间的 goal-directed coherence，few-shot 只教了\"什么算停滞\"但没教\"如何\n      系统性地追踪 progress across steps\"；\n\n      (2) LLM 的核心盲点在于 diverse-action stagnation（agent 做了编辑、运行、读文件等\n      多样操作，看起来 productive 但实际没有推进 goal），这类模式即使有 exemplars 也很难\n      被 LLM 通过单次阅读识别——需要对比前后状态差异，而非仅读动作序列；\n\n      (3) CoT 增加了 token 开销 ~60%，但换来的准确率提升有限，因为 stagnation 判断的\n      bottleneck 不是\"推理不够\"而是\"信息提取不够\"——LLM 需要的是结构化特征（文件变化频率、\n      命令重复率）而非更长的推理链。\n\n      0.723 仍大幅低于 structural 0.948（-22.5pp）和 probe 0.861（-13.8pp），效率差距\n      在 best-case LLM 配置下依然显著。这验证了核心 claim：structural features 的优势\n      不是因为 LLM baseline 太弱，而是任务本质上更适合结构化特征提取。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge Variants on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Configuration\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"F1-stag\", \"F1-prog\", \"Cost (USD)\", \"Latency/window\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Zero-shot\", \"0.6891\", \"0.6203\", \"0.7579\", \"$11.66†\", \"~2.1s\"]\n          - [\"5-shot + CoT\", \"0.7234\", \"0.6712\", \"0.7756\", \"$18.92\", \"~3.2s\"]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", \"0.9485\", \"0.9253\", \"0.9717\", \"$0\", \"<5ms\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8034\", \"0.9190\", \"$0\", \"~12ms\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Error Analysis — LLM Few-shot on Gold\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"Count\", \"%\", \"Dominant Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP (predicted stag, gold prog)\", \"72\", \"40.0%\", \"Repetitive debugging loops that are actually effective\"]\n          - [\"FN (predicted prog, gold stag)\", \"108\", \"60.0%\", \"Diverse-action stagnation looking productive\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Radar chart comparing zero-shot vs few-shot LLM judge across 6 dimensions (precision-stag, recall-stag, precision-prog, recall-prog, cost-efficiency, latency). Few-shot improves recall-stag most (+4pp) but at 60% higher cost.\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-judge fewshot 的 0.723 为论文提供了 strongest possible LLM baseline。即使在 few-shot +\n      CoT 的最优配置下，structural features 仍领先 22.5pp，probe 仍领先 13.8pp。这消除了\n      \"zero-shot baseline 太弱\" 的 reviewer concern。论文可以 claim：\"Even with optimized\n      prompting (5-shot + CoT), LLM-as-judge achieves only 0.723 F1 on gold-validated labels,\n      22.5pp below structural features — the efficiency gap is fundamental, not prompt-engineering\n      addressable.\" Cost comparison 更 dramatic：$18.92 for 650 windows vs $0 for structural。\n\n  - name: \"structural-feature-overlap-ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"structural-feature-overlap-ablation\"\n    description: \"从 30-dim structural vector 中移除所有与 LF 逻辑直接重叠的特征（cmd_rep 相关 ~8 features + file_diff 相关 ~6 features），仅保留 ~16 个非重叠特征，在 gold set 上评估残差 F1\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_features: 30\n      removed_lf_overlap_features: 14\n      remaining_non_overlap_features: 16\n      removed_features_list: [\"cmd_rep_ratio\", \"cmd_rep_max_consecutive\", \"cmd_rep_unique_ratio\", \"cmd_rep_entropy\", \"cmd_rep_bigram_repeat\", \"cmd_rep_last3_repeat\", \"cmd_rep_pattern_score\", \"cmd_rep_binary\", \"file_diff_ratio\", \"file_diff_count\", \"file_diff_unique_files\", \"file_diff_lines_changed\", \"file_diff_binary\", \"file_diff_entropy\"]\n      remaining_features_examples: [\"output_length_mean\", \"output_length_std\", \"step_duration_mean\", \"error_rate\", \"unique_commands\", \"command_diversity\", \"directory_changes\", \"token_count_trend\", \"action_type_entropy\", \"response_length_ratio\", \"edit_revert_ratio\", \"tool_switch_rate\", \"semantic_similarity_mean\", \"output_novelty_score\", \"goal_mention_rate\", \"progress_keyword_ratio\"]\n      # Gold evaluation\n      overlap_ablation_gold_rf_macro_f1: 0.8821\n      overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_stag: 0.8412\n      overlap_ablation_gold_rf_f1_prog: 0.9230\n      overlap_ablation_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.8903\n      overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_stag: 0.8534\n      overlap_ablation_gold_gb_f1_prog: 0.9272\n      # Residual F1 (key metric)\n      residual_f1: 0.8903\n      residual_f1_ci95_low: 0.8651\n      residual_f1_ci95_high: 0.9127\n      # Comparison\n      full_30_gold_gb_macro_f1: 0.9485\n      delta_vs_full_pp: -5.82\n      delta_vs_probe_pp: 2.91\n      # Feature importance (remaining)\n      top3_remaining_importance: [\"output_novelty_score\", \"action_type_entropy\", \"edit_revert_ratio\"]\n      # LF-eval for comparison\n      overlap_ablation_lf_eval_macro_f1: 0.9312\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 overlap ablation residual F1 ≥0.85。移除 14 个与 LF 直接重叠的特征后\n      仍保持 0.890 的 gold F1，证明 structural signal 有独立于 LF 逻辑的信息贡献。\n\n      为什么残差 F1 高达 0.89：(1) 剩余 16 个特征（output novelty、action entropy、edit\n      revert 等）捕获了 stagnation 的\"行为指纹\"——停滞窗口不仅命令重复和文件不变，还\n      伴随 output 长度下降、行为多样性降低、工具切换频率下降等模式；(2) 这些特征虽然\n      与 LF 逻辑无直接重叠，但与 stagnation 有 causal 关系——真正停滞的 agent 会在多个\n      维度同时表现出退化；(3) GB 的非线性组合能力让 16 个弱特征的联合预测力接近 14 个\n      强特征的单独预测力。\n\n      降幅 5.8pp 是合理的：被移除的 14 个特征直接编码了 LF 的两个核心启发式（cmd_rep\n      和 file_diff），它们本身就是 stagnation 的强信号。但 \"强信号被移除后仍有 0.89\"\n      正是关键论证——structural approach 的价值不仅在于重新发现 LF 逻辑，而在于捕获\n      LF 未覆盖的补充维度。\n\n      Residual F1 0.89 > probe gold F1 0.86 (+2.9pp) 进一步强化了 structural approach\n      的优势论证：即使只用非 LF-overlap 的特征，structural 仍 ≥ probe。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Overlap Ablation on Gold Set\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"N features\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Gold F1-stag\", \"Δ vs Full\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full structural\", \"30\", \"0.9485\", \"0.9253\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Non-overlap only\", \"16\", \"0.8903\", \"0.8534\", \"-5.82pp\"]\n          - [\"LF-overlap only\", \"14\", \"0.9289\", \"0.9051\", \"-1.96pp\"]\n          - [\"GRU Probe (ref)\", \"1024-dim\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8034\", \"-8.73pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Top Non-Overlap Feature Importances (GB, gold-evaluated)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature\", \"Importance\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"output_novelty_score\", \"0.183\", \"Low novelty in outputs → stagnation\"]\n          - [\"action_type_entropy\", \"0.156\", \"Low action diversity → stagnation\"]\n          - [\"edit_revert_ratio\", \"0.134\", \"High revert rate → ineffective edits\"]\n          - [\"token_count_trend\", \"0.098\", \"Declining token use → disengagement\"]\n          - [\"tool_switch_rate\", \"0.087\", \"Low tool switching → stuck in one mode\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Venn diagram showing 3 signal sources: LF-overlap features (14), non-overlap structural (16), and probe embedding. Overlap region labeled with gold F1 for each combination.\"\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance heatmap for 16 non-overlap features, split by gold-stag vs gold-prog predictions. Shows complementary signal dimensions beyond LF logic.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Overlap ablation 是 circularity concern 的最终解答。Reviewer 可能 argue \"structural\n      F1 高仅因为 features 直接编码了 LF 规则\"——ablation 证明即使移除所有 LF-overlap\n      features，残差 F1=0.89 仍然 (a) 远高于 random (0.50)，(b) 高于 probe (0.86)，\n      (c) 在实用部署范围内。论文叙事：\"Even after removing all features that overlap\n      with LF heuristics, the remaining 16 structural features achieve 0.89 F1 on\n      gold — demonstrating that structural stagnation detection captures signal\n      dimensions beyond what labeling functions encode.\" 这把 circular evaluation\n      从 \"fatal flaw\" 变成 \"well-characterized and controlled confound\"。\n\n  - name: \"cross-agent-instance-isolation\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent-instance-isolation\"\n    description: \"重新评估 cross-agent structural GB：确保 SWE-bench 训练集中无任何 instance 在 OH 测试集中出现（排除 shared benchmark instances 的信息泄露）\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Data split details\n      swe_train_instances: 344\n      oh_test_instances: 3394\n      shared_benchmark_instances: 0\n      note_on_sharing: \"SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 使用不同的 SWE-bench split，无 instance 共享；但此实验确认 structural features 不通过 problem-level 特征泄露\"\n      # Instance-level isolation protocol\n      isolation_method: \"确保 structural feature 中无 instance-identifying 信息（如 repo name encoding、issue ID）。对 OH test 按 repo 分层评估排除 repo-level 泄露。\"\n      # Results\n      gb_instance_isolated_macro_f1: 0.9612\n      gb_instance_isolated_f1_stag: 0.9403\n      gb_instance_isolated_f1_prog: 0.9821\n      # Per-repo stratification\n      gb_seen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9687\n      gb_unseen_repos_macro_f1: 0.9534\n      gb_unseen_repos_delta_pp: -1.53\n      # Comparison with original\n      gb_original_cross_agent_all: 0.9674\n      delta_vs_original_pp: -0.62\n      # Statistical test\n      mcnemar_p_vs_original: 0.43\n      bootstrap_ci95_low: 0.9498\n      bootstrap_ci95_high: 0.9719\n      # Probe comparison under same isolation\n      probe_zeroshot_isolated_macro_f1: 0.5921\n      structural_advantage_isolated_pp: 36.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 instance isolation 后 GB ≥0.95。预测 0.961 的理由：\n\n      (1) SWE-Agent 和 OpenHands 本身处理不同的 SWE-bench instances（不同 split），\n      所以 instance-level 信息泄露的风险本来就很低。Structural features（cmd_rep_ratio、\n      file_diff_count 等）是 agent 行为特征，不编码 problem identity——一个 agent 在\n      处理任何 bug 时的停滞行为模式是相似的（重复命令、文件不变、输出不变），与具体\n      修什么 bug 无关。\n\n      (2) 轻微降幅 0.62pp 来自 repo-level 的 minor distribution shift：某些 repo 的\n      代码结构可能导致 agent 行为模式略有不同（如大型 monorepo vs 小型 library），\n      但效应极小因为 structural features 在 abstraction level 上足够高——它们度量的是\n      行为模式（重复/变化/趋势）而非内容。\n\n      (3) Seen vs unseen repos 差距仅 1.5pp，证明 structural features 的跨域迁移不依赖\n      repo familiarity。这与 structural features 的设计一致：它们度量的是 agent 行为\n      的 meta-patterns（是否在重复、是否在变化），完全独立于具体代码库。\n\n      (4) Probe 在 isolation 条件下几乎不变（0.592 vs 0.598），因为 probe 的 zero-shot\n      failure 是 domain shift 问题而非泄露问题。Structural advantage 在 isolation 后\n      从 36.9pp 变为 36.9pp（几乎不变），进一步证明优势是真实的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instance Isolation Evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"GB Macro-F1\", \"F1-stag\", \"N windows\", \"Δ vs Original\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Original (all OH)\", \"0.9674\", \"0.9479\", \"150652\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Instance-isolated\", \"0.9612\", \"0.9403\", \"150652\", \"-0.62pp\"]\n          - [\"— Seen repos only\", \"0.9687\", \"0.9512\", \"89432\", \"+0.13pp\"]\n          - [\"— Unseen repos only\", \"0.9534\", \"0.9287\", \"61220\", \"-1.53pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Isolation Impact on All Methods\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Original\", \"Isolated\", \"Δpp\", \"McNemar p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural GB\", \"0.9674\", \"0.9612\", \"-0.62\", \"0.43\"]\n          - [\"Probe zero-shot\", \"0.5984\", \"0.5921\", \"-0.63\", \"0.71\"]\n          - [\"Advantage (struct-probe)\", \"+36.90pp\", \"+36.91pp\", \"+0.01\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Box plot of per-repo structural GB F1 分布，split by seen/unseen repos. Both distributions concentrated above 0.93 with high overlap, confirming repo-independence.\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot: x=repo size (LOC), y=GB F1 under isolation. No correlation (r=0.03), confirming features are scale-invariant.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Instance isolation 实验关闭了最后一个 data leakage concern。降幅仅 0.62pp 且\n      统计不显著（McNemar p=0.43），证明 structural GB 0.967 的 cross-agent 性能是\n      genuine transfer 而非 information leakage artifact。Unseen repos 上仅降 1.5pp\n      更进一步：即使 agent 面对全新代码库，structural stagnation detection 仍然有效。\n      论文可以 claim：\"Cross-agent transfer is robust to instance isolation\n      (Δ=-0.62pp, p=0.43), confirming that structural features capture agent\n      behavioral patterns independent of the specific problem being solved.\"\n      与 probe 的对比在 isolation 条件下几乎完全不变（36.9pp），这是最干净的\n      dominance evidence。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c9a91e77-a40a-45d4-af92-e3fde4b7646a","total_cost_usd":0.482134,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38438,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":8099,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38438,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":8099,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38438,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38438},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":33401,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.033491,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":8099,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":38438,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.448643,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ea0d7bbc-3241-4e6a-bc56-cce266a5a9ab"}
